  "description": "Meet the Munroe SG Commuter - a drop bar bike built to elevate your daily ride. With a lightweight aluminium frame and fork equipped with cage, rack, and fender mounts, it’s ready for year round commuting in any weather. Integrated lighting powered by a hub dynamo keeps you visible and safe without the hassle of charging. The Microshift Sword 2x10 wide-range drivetrain with a clutched rear derailleur delivers smooth, reliable shifting across varied terrain. Bombtrack’s own Ward aluminum fenders and Dive rear rack come standard, offering full coverage and load-carrying capability. Rolling on tubeless-ready WTB ST i21 double-wall rims, the Munroe SG Commuter is practical, durable, and purpose-built for everyday efficiency with drop bar speed and control.",
